  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A galaxy emits light of wavelength of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{G}\"></span>. When this light is detected on Earth, its wavelength is measured to be <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{E}\"></span>. What is the relative direction of motion and the relative speed of the galaxy compared to those of the Earth if <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{E} &gt; \\lambda_{G}\"></span>?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of motion</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Speed</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Away from Earth</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{c(\\lambda_{E} - \\lambda_{G})}{\\lambda_{G}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Away from Earth</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{c(\\lambda_{E} - \\lambda_{G})}{\\lambda_{E}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Towards Earth</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{c(\\lambda_{E} - \\lambda_{G})}{\\lambda_{G}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Towards Earth</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{c(\\lambda_{E} - \\lambda_{G})}{\\lambda_{E}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
